<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．各组要召开推荐评比会议，通过交流，对照评比条件民主评议，把真正优秀的人选推荐出来；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">．推荐过程中不能论资排辈，不能搞照顾，不能拉票，建议多向超工作量、业绩突出的教师倾斜；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
